        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017, Copyright the Authors Journal compilation © 2017, The American Geriatrics Society.",
        "AbstractText": "This paper is a statement of the American Geriatrics Society's (AGS) core policy priorities and the Society's positions on federal programs and policies that support older Americans as articulated to the new administration. Among the AGS priorities discussed in this paper are health reform, Medicare, and Medicaid. The AGS is committed to leveraging its expertise to inform regulatory and legislative policy proposals."
